Wizards start with a cloak of magic resistance, which will reduce the
paralysis attack to one turn. The simplest way to kill a priest (or
any other peaceful) is to have your pet do it; if that's not an
option, try to stay out of melee range...

I *think* the priest will be peaceful; but if he is outside the temple
or if the altar has been converted, he will become hostile if you try
to #chat with him, so don't.


